\title{shinytoxcalc: A Graphical Interface to the toxcalc EPA WET Methods}
\description{
A Shiny application providing a point-and-click interface to the 'toxcalc' package, which implements the US EPA Whole Effluent Toxicity statistical methods. Data are entered by pasting, by uploading a comma-separated file, or by uploading a spreadsheet laid out to the supplied template. Results are presented as the decision trail that justifies the selected test, alongside the endpoints and a concentration-response plot, and can be exported as a report, a spreadsheet, or the R code that reproduces the analysis.
